@guide A_Darkshore
@name Darkshore
@faction Alliance
@levels 11-20
@zone Darkshore
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Auberdine, Bashal'Aran, the beached sea creatures, the Cliffspring River and southern Darkshore. Ends at about 19-20 heading south to Ashenvale.
@next A_Ashenvale

